{"seq":3,"slug":"language-policy","title":"语言政策","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-policy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"language-planning","title":"语言规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-policy/language-planning","wordCount":1755,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"language-rights","title":"语言权利与语言平等","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-policy/language-rights","wordCount":1856,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"language-endangerment","title":"语言濒危与语言保护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-policy/language-endangerment","wordCount":2297,"readingTime":10},{"seq":4,"slug":"multilingualism","title":"多语言主义与语言接触","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-policy/multilingualism","wordCount":2101,"readingTime":9},{"seq":5,"slug":"language-planning","title":"语言规划与语言教育政策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/linguistics/sociolinguistics/language-policy/language-planning","wordCount":2133,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"语言政策-简介\">语言政策 简介</h1><p>本章进入语言治理的宏观领域，从语言规划到语言权利再到语言保护，帮助读者理解语言政策如何影响社会的语言生态。</p>\n<p><strong>语言规划与标准化</strong>讲解语言规划的类型和目标，分析语言标准化的过程与争议，以及语言政策在国家建设中的作用。</p>\n<p><strong>语言权利与语言平等</strong>讨论语言权利作为基本人权的理念基础，分析少数民族语言权利保障的国际实践和面临的挑战。</p>\n<p><strong>语言濒危与语言保护</strong>介绍全球语言濒危的现状和评估标准，讲解语言记录、语言复兴和社区语言保护的方法与实践案例。</p>\n<p>建议读者关注自身所处社会的语言政策实践，将理论知识与现实语言生态观察结合起来。</p>\n"}